.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt UPDATE_DATA 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm update_data
.Nd save the next Hetzner server-auction snapshot
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm update_data
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
downloads the public server-auction feed and stores it as the next consecutive
.Pa data/N.json.xz
file.
Run it from the repository directory.
It takes no arguments.
.Pp
The index starts at 0.
The first
.Pa data/N.json
or
.Pa data/N.json.xz
that is absent is the file that gets written.
The download uses
.Xr ftp 1
and the compression is
.Xr xz 1
.Fl 9e .
The URL is
.Lk https://www.hetzner.com/_resources/app/jsondata/live_data_sb.json .
.Pp
.Xr hmarket 1
reads the highest consecutive
.Pa data/N.json.xz
and does not download this feed itself.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa data/N.json.xz
Snapshot written by this program.
Gitignored.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The exit status is the status of
.Xr xz 1 ,
or of
.Xr ftp 1
if the download fails.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ftp 1 ,
.Xr hmarket 1 ,
.Xr xz 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Todd T. Fries Aq Mt todd@fries.net
